<title>POLAND: Poland mulls sale of minority stake in TPSA.</title>
<headline>Poland mulls sale of minority stake in TPSA.</headline>
<dateline>KRAKOW, Poland 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Telecoms Ministry is mulling the sale of 10 percent of existing shares of the telecoms monopolist TPSA in early 1998 and then a capital raise of 15 percent, a deputy minister said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
